<lb/>vs</p>
<p>Remit except fees &amp; costs
<lb/>Tho E Bramlette</p>
<p>Jas Wells Jr
<lb/>$20 -- 
<lb/><date when="1864-02-15">15<hi rend="sup">th</hi> Feby 1864</date></p>
